[ti:Glass Lanterns]
[ar:The Paper Moths]
[al:Night Market]
[length:03:20]
[by:ytm-glow test fixture, original text]
[00:10.00]Hang the glass lanterns over the river
[00:14.50]Every one is a wish we forgot
[00:19.00]Hold the light till the morning delivers
[00:23.40]
[00:30.00]Paper moths in the summer weather
[00:34.20]Fold the night into something bright
[00:38.60]We were never alone together
[00:43.00]Lanterns, lanterns, carry the light
